{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0103_1000_p", "source_sha256": "5c3614783859917456e0dc9f6ce914dd131e25c72785ecafed0e1e1fa308c7af", "ja": "（劇場で奈緒達の公演を見てくれた記者の人から、\nインタビューの申し込みが来た）", "zh": "（有位记者来剧场看了奈绪她们的公演后，\n希望能访问她们。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0103_1001_p", "source_sha256": "4d371e868164cddca0b505b69e74a296d5f72f190e9775181d6b56b60c84b54e", "ja": "待ち合わせ場所は……ここだな。\n先方は、まだ来てないみたいだ。", "zh": "碰面的地方在……这里是吧。\n对方好像还没到。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0103_1002_037nao", "source_sha256": "ea9d91345ef31a95637eaf9285773ac7de2f0e8d2627afc67658745401731519", "ja": "なぁ、{$P$}さん？　今日の\nインタビューは、オシャレなカフェでするんですよね？", "zh": "我说，{$P$}先生？\n今天是要在时髦的咖啡厅接受采访，对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0103_1003_037nao", "source_sha256": "0ab8e4e2b59b74bbedb860ce36118e98a247db98af63e157152c2aa02ceda1d4", "ja": "都会はやっぱり違いますね～。\nオシャレなカフェのメニュー、今から楽しみやわ♪", "zh": "大都市真的不一样耶～\n我已经迫不及待想尝尝时髦咖啡厅的餐点了♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0103_1004_p", "source_sha256": "4753a61898a71d50a9cf9c33207c306004a76bd352ec68c11dada3a5ec586714", "ja": "奈緒。今日はグルメリポートじゃなくて、\nインタビューだからな？　頼むぞ？", "zh": "奈绪，今天可不是来做美食报导，\n而是来接受采访的！拜托你别搞砸啰！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0103_1005_037nao", "source_sha256": "d036470fc7fbf1260c024952fcfa248e0cc40cd77e8a8b153782731b1a119c7c", "ja": "{$P$}さん、心配せんでも大丈夫\nやって！　雰囲気に合うように、今日はバッチリ……。", "zh": "{$P$}先生，你尽管放心嘿！\n为了配合店里气氛，我可是完美……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0103_1006_037nao", "source_sha256": "396b61c7aa835410ba9b50251adc82e06e30b88e63fa2f43e792965c701ebf6e", "ja": "……はっ！？", "zh": "……啊！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0103_1007_p", "source_sha256": "c630dd6c19acb2858d5f0def3249d25eddb9977243bb3579cbcdded44a979225", "ja": "どうしたんだ、奈緒。\n何か忘れ物か？", "zh": "怎么了，奈绪？\n忘了带什么东西吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0103_1008_037nao", "source_sha256": "d332f58e8a9f79006991805fa56a5c37199bde8706f8b5b4648763e489eb7fd6", "ja": "ち、ちゃうんです、{$P$}さん！\nいま私の心ん中の、大阪の近所のおばちゃんが……！", "zh": "不、不是啦，{$P$}先生！\n刚才我心里头住在大阪的邻居大婶……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0103_1009_p", "source_sha256": "60f76ff73b472f3a7aa5d86e8966dd055a47834fe99903a88b7adac5305822c6", "ja": "心の中の、大阪の近所のおばちゃん……？\nそれは……近いのか遠いのか、どっちなんだ？", "zh": "心里头住在大阪的邻居大婶……？\n那究竟……是近还是远啊？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0103_1010_037nao", "source_sha256": "204bee562fc1c496f78489ba1395c4d746eeed4071102286b2414038b62cc3bb", "ja": "そんなんどっちでもいいですやん！\nそれより大変なんです！　おばちゃんが私のこと……。", "zh": "是近是远都无所谓啦！\n更要紧的是！刚刚那位大婶……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0103_1011_037nao", "source_sha256": "b6e3d9253ab9b861a6767ab82df66a45608169619a522dc9ca0805350300cb6e", "ja": "めっちゃ寂しそうな目で見てたんです！\n私、東京に染まってしもたんやろか……！？", "zh": "用很落寞的眼神看着我！\n是不是我被东京荼毒得太深了……！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0103_1012_p", "source_sha256": "698bceb8b2cde22b3e18c7997b79111a01188443db7d58daa8772fe9dfeca06c", "ja": "え？", "zh": "什么？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0103_1013_037nao", "source_sha256": "bed4e5e91b4a8b8b21d4aff63d5f96c18a240fc228594cb9aa85cc86fb318a41", "ja": "こんなオシャレスポットにも馴染んでるし、\n東京弁も知らんうちにペラペラになってもうたし……。", "zh": "我不只对这种时髦景点变熟悉，\n连东京腔也不知不觉讲得越来越流畅……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0103_1015_037nao", "source_sha256": "a72774534dc9bf17f8201d094b75196b35050ca6600ffbe0ac2c46c4214f937d", "ja": "アカン……このままじゃ、『関西の星』失格や！\n大阪の魂を、早く取り戻さんと！", "zh": "不行……再这样下去，我没脸担任『关西之星』啦！\n得赶快找回我的大阪魂才行咩！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0103_1016_037nao", "source_sha256": "8d5f2f92f4677304e47eb37e15455f1906f457a0d93801dd75983d2b9c4942c9", "ja": "{$P$}さん、たこ焼き食べましょう！\nマヨネーズとソース、アオノリもたっぷりで！", "zh": "{$P$}先生，我们去吃章鱼烧吧！\n上头要淋满美乃滋、酱汁，还有海苔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0103_1017_p", "source_sha256": "f44eef6a9422ecd634e6126122d9172dabd0efe8ed9e829c736407c28cd627e3", "ja": "あ、待て奈緒！　もうすぐ待ち合わせの時間が……！\nあと写真も撮るから、アオノリはダメだ！", "zh": "啊，等一下，奈绪！跟记者约好的时间就快到了……！\n而且待会还要拍照，不可以吃海苔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0103_1018_p", "source_sha256": "0720875d1a18ba8011fc822faa147991cd6e461b3eee2cb0e017429075542e15", "ja": "（この後、記者さんから遅れるとの連絡が入り、\n奈緒はたこ焼き休憩をもぎ取った……）", "zh": "（之后那位记者联络我们说会晚点到，\n结果就这么硬是给奈绪凹到了吃章鱼烧的休息时间……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0103_1019_p", "source_sha256": "3345a0073d5d2e35fda86465e9a67be2be137af3931ac56add87827f248089e5", "ja": "（インタビューは無事成功……\n粉物パワー、恐るべしだな！）", "zh": "（最后采访也顺利成功了……\n面粉的力量，不容小觑！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
